**LOAN AGREEMENT**

**January 14, 2021**

**BETWEEN:**

**GLOBEX CORPORATION,**

A Delaware corporation, having its principal place of business at 1234 Main Street, Anytown, USA 12345, ("Parent");

**SUBSI-TECH INC.**,

A Delaware corporation, having its principal place of business at 5678 Second Avenue, Anycity, USA 67890, a wholly-owned subsidiary of Parent ("Subsi-Tech");

**AND**

**MEGA-BANK PLC**,

A public limited company organized under the laws of England and Wales, having its principal place of business at 9010 High Street, Mega-City, England, UK ("Lender").

**WHEREAS:**

1.1 Parent is the parent company of Subsi-Tech;

1.2 Parent and Subsi-Tech desire to borrow from the Lender the sum of $10,000,000 (Ten Million US Dollars) (the "Loan");

1.3 The Lender is willing to lend the Loan to Parent and Subsi-Tech under the terms and conditions set forth herein.

**LOAN TERMS**

2.1 The Loan shall consist of a principal amount of $10,000,000, bearing interest at the rate of 5.00% per annum, calculated on a 360-day year (the "Interest Rate").

2.2 The Loan shall be repaid in equal installments of principal and interest on the first day of each month, commencing on January 1, 2022, and ending on December 1, 2025 (the "Loan Term").

2.3 The Loan shall be secured by a first-priority security interest in all present and future assets of Parent and Subsi-Tech, as security for the Loan and any accrued interest.

**INTEREST AND FEES**

3.1 The Lender shall be entitled to receive interest on the Loan at the rate of 5.00% per annum.

3.2 The Lender shall be entitled to receive a commitment fee of 0.50% per annum, calculated on the Loan amount, payable quarterly in arrears.

**DEFAULT AND REMEDIES**

4.1 If Parent or Subsi-Tech (together, the "Borrowers") default under this Agreement, the Lender may declare all or any portion of the Loan immediately due and payable.

4.2 In the event of default, the Lender shall have the right, but not the obligation, to exercise any of its rights and remedies under applicable law, including foreclosure, sale of the securities, and any other remedies available to a secured creditor.

4.3 If any default occurs, the Lender may, without waiving any other rights or remedies, charge the Borrowers for all reasonable costs and expenses (including legal fees and expenses) incurred by the Lender in enforcing its rights under this Agreement.

**SIGNATURES**

In witness whereof, the parties have executed this Loan Agreement as of the date first above written.

